# Read by stow when run from the repo root.
# Always link per file, never a whole folder: tools (and local zellij layouts) can then add
# files next to the links without them landing in the repo.
--no-folding
# Profiles are `core mocha` or `core latte`. The theme packages don't overlap each other,
# but both replace core's helix fallback theme, which has no include support.
--override=\.config/helix/themes/custom\.toml
